<title>MEXICO: Invex 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Invex 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Financiero Invex, S.A. de C.V. said on Friday that its net profits in 1996 were 174.14 million pesos, compared to 29.66 million pesos in 1995.</p>
<p>Operating profits in 1996 fell to 1.72 million pesos compared to 2.9 million pesos in 1995, it said.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559))</p>
